cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this experimental software if you use it in research."
type: software
title: "Experimental FLAC compression extension for libmseed"
authors:
  - family-names: Akimov
    given-names: Andrei
version: "FLAC21"
abstract: >-
  Experimental lossless FLAC compression inside fixed-length miniSEED2
  records, with independent channel buffering, parallel repacking and exact
  sample comparison. Encoding 21 is experimental and is not FDSN-assigned.
  Based on libmseed 3.5.4 and unmodified libFLAC 1.5.0.
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - seismology
  - miniSEED
  - lossless compression
  - FLAC
